-## 0.2.2 refinements
-
-- Enables **Preview Changes** and **Copy and Verify** for both Host → Repair and Repair → Host.
-- Uses `rsync -aHAX --numeric-ids` and never adds `--delete`; unrelated destination files remain in place.
